  m_text: 'The Standard Armed Unit of the GAIA PROTOCOL.


    Capable of <color=#b3fbff>Dealing
    Damage</color> against corrupted lifeforms.


    However, this is <color=red>incapable</color>
    of <color=red>slaying Kaijus</color>, but they can <color=yellow>stagger</color>
    them when dealt enough damage.'
